      <div class="landing-steps"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Find your brand.</h3><p>Explore brands and products for your next gifting brief.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Meet your supplier.</h3><p>Connect with authorized suppliers who carry what you need.</p></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Make it happen.</h3><p>Check stock, request a quote and plan your business order.</p></article></div>
